KNOWNBUG
main.c
--arrays-uf-always --no-standard-checks
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
CBMC crashes (SIGABRT) with an invariant violation in arrays.cpp when using
--arrays-uf-always on code with array-of-structs containing array members
accessed through a nondet index. The arrays theory does not handle member
expressions where the struct operand is an index expression.
